,0.392,0.278,0.242,0.226,0.196,0.19,0.168,0.144,0.123,0.109,0.094,0.083,0.074,0.177,0.219,0.188,0.142,0.052,0.036,0.032,0.028,0.024,0.017,0.012,0.009,0.006,0.004,0.002],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"ADDITIONAL TIPS FOR PARENTS","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Just like all @pet_type s, @pet_name has a strong sense of curiosity – but enough sense to stay away from creepy houses? Probably not. Go to your local creepy house and find out. Let's ask it together.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":38},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":38},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"\" Hi! Have you seen Squeaky?\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":5},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":5},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"\"Shhhh! There’s no need to shout. [Creak, Sigh] Every day… the honking… the bonking… the clanging… the banging… dinging… and singing. Just non… stop… noise. [Creak, Sigh] Ever heard of peace and quiet?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":3.808,"end":24.608,"frac":0.848,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":33},"large":{"start":3.808,"end":24.52,"frac":0.848,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":33},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"\"I’d like to. I’d like to hear all about it, but no. That’s not what I get. It’s unbearable. [Creak, Sigh]","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":27.744,"end":36.192,"frac":0.905,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":21},"large":{"start":24.52,"end":36.192,"frac":0.905,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":21},"differ":true},{"i":5,"text":"\"Just like today when that animal came sniffing around. Sniff… snuff… huff… puff… Eugh! And it had this squeaky toy in its mouth. Squeeeak!!!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":38.112,"end":50.42,"frac":0.958,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":24},"large":{"start":35.7,"end":50.3,"frac":0.958,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":24},"differ":true},{"i":6,"text":"\"Insufferable! I thought they’d never leave. Then we all heard this even higher-pitched squeal, like a siren or a yelping child, and they ran off. Good riddance, I say!\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":52.896,"end":68.992,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":27,"words":30},"large":{"start":52.896,"end":68.992,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":30},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[{"start":69.62,"end":74.98,"words":16,"text":"where to next open the story city app to follow the map to your selected destination"}],"large":[{"start":69.22,"end":74.6,"words":17,"text":"where to next next open the story city app to follow the map to your selected destination"}]},"image":null}